# Commerce.js — Diagram Design Brief

Complete reference for redesigning all diagrams in a graphics editor. Each diagram uses **abstract, conceptual terms** — not package names.

## Color Palette

| Role | Hex | Name | Usage |
|---|---|---|---|
| Application | `#10b981` | Emerald | Storefront, apps, success |
| Engine | `#3b82f6` | Blue | Core engine, orchestration |
| Data Model | `#818cf8` | Indigo | Types, unified data layer |
| Integration | `#06b6d4` | Cyan | Adapters, providers |
| Framework | `#f59e0b` | Amber | Nuxt module |
| Error | `#ef4444` | Red | Failed states |
| External | `#71717a` | Zinc | Third-party platforms/gateways |

**Design specs:** SVG, 800px max width, 12px corners on containers, 8px on nodes, Inter font, light + dark variants.  
**Export to:** `packages/docs/public/images/diagrams/`

---

## Diagram 1 — System Architecture

> **Used on:** Landing page, Architecture Overview  
> **Type:** Layered block diagram (vertical stack)  
> **Inspiration:** Alokai architecture diagram  

### Structure (top to bottom)

```
APPLICATION LAYER
├── Storefront UI
└── Framework Module

COMMERCE ENGINE
├── Unified Data Model
├── Orchestration Engine
└── Checkout Engine

INTEGRATION LAYER
├── Platform Adapters
├── Payment Providers
└── Webhook Security

EXTERNAL (icons/logos below)
├── eCommerce (Salla, Shopify, WC, Custom)
├── Gateways (Tap, Stripe, PayPal)
└── Events (Webhooks)
```

### Layout

- 3 nested rounded containers (Application → Engine → Integration), each with a label on the left edge
- Inside each container: full-width blocks stacked vertically
- Integration layer has 3 blocks side-by-side
- Below the main container: a row of small square icons (dark gray) representing external services, connected by dashed arrows

### Colors

| Layer | Container border | Block fill |
|---|---|---|
| Application | `#10b981` | `#10b981` |
| Commerce Engine | `#3b82f6` | `#3b82f6` / `#818cf8` for Data Model |
| Integration | `#06b6d4` | `#06b6d4` |
| External icons | — | `#3f3f46` (zinc-700) |

### Text in each block

| Block | Label | Subtitle (optional) |
|---|---|---|
| Storefront UI | **Storefront UI** | Components, pages, layouts |
| Framework Module | **Framework Module** | Auto-imports, composables, server routes |
| Unified Data Model | **Unified Data Model** | 20+ domain types, shared vocabulary |
| Orchestration Engine | **Orchestration** | Event bus, capability routing, multi-provider |
| Checkout Engine | **Checkout Engine** | State machine, payment lifecycle |
| Platform Adapters | **Platform Adapters** | Map any API to unified types |
| Payment Providers | **Payment Providers** | Pluggable gateway interface |
| Webhook Security | **Webhook Security** | Cryptographic verification |

### External icons row

| Icon | Label |
|---|---|
| 🛒 | eCommerce |
| ⚙️ | CMS |
| 🔍 | Search |
| 🔐 | Auth |
| ••• | ... |

