## Diagram 3 — Checkout Lifecycle

> **Used on:** Checkout Flow page, Quick Start  
> **Type:** Horizontal pipeline / state rail  

### States (left to right)

```
○ Start → [ Collect Info ] → [ Shipping ] → [ Process Payment ] → [ Verify & Capture ] → ◉ Complete
                                                     │                     │
                                                     └─────────────────────┤
                                                                           ↓
                                                                     ◉ Failed
                                                                       │
                                                                       └── retry ──→ (back to Process Payment)
```

### Node details

| State | Abstract Label | Color | Shape |
|---|---|---|---|
| Start | ○ | `#3b82f6` | Circle |
| Collect Info | **Collect Info** | `#3b82f6` | Rounded rect |
| Shipping | **Shipping Details** | `#3b82f6` | Rounded rect |
| Process Payment | **Process Payment** | `#818cf8` | Rounded rect |
| Verify & Capture | **Verify & Capture** | `#818cf8` | Rounded rect |
| Complete | **Order Complete** | `#10b981` | Stadium/pill |
| Failed | **Payment Failed** | `#ef4444` | Stadium/pill |

### Edges

| From | To | Style | Label |
|---|---|---|---|
| Start | Collect Info | Solid thick | — |
| Collect Info | Shipping | Solid thick | — |
| Shipping | Process Payment | Solid thick | — |
| Process Payment | Verify & Capture | Solid thick | 3DS or direct |
| Verify & Capture | Complete | Solid thick green | Captured |
| Verify & Capture | Failed | Dotted red | Declined |
| Process Payment | Complete | Dashed | Webhook |
| Process Payment | Failed | Dotted red | Webhook declined |
| Failed | Process Payment | Thin gray | Retry |

