## Diagram 4 — Payment Flow

> **Used on:** Hosted Checkout page  
> **Type:** Sequence / swim-lane diagram  

### Participants

| Lane | Label | Color |
|---|---|---|
| Left | **Merchant** | `#71717a` |
| Center-left | **Checkout Page** | `#3b82f6` |
| Center-right | **Payment Gateway** | `#06b6d4` |
| Right | **Customer** | `#10b981` |

### Steps

| # | From | To | Message | Style |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Merchant | Checkout Page | Create Session | Solid arrow |
| 2 | Checkout Page | Merchant | Session URL | Dashed return |
| 3 | Merchant | Customer | Redirect to Checkout | Solid arrow |
| 4 | Customer | Checkout Page | Enter Payment Details | Solid arrow |
| 5 | Checkout Page | Gateway | Submit Payment | Solid arrow |
| 6 | Gateway | Customer | 3D Secure Verification | Solid arrow |
| 7 | Customer | Checkout Page | Return from 3DS | Solid arrow |
| 8 | Checkout Page | Gateway | Confirm Payment | Solid arrow |
| 9 | Gateway | Checkout Page | Webhook — Captured | Dashed arrow |
| 10 | Checkout Page | Customer | Order Confirmed ✓ | Solid green |

